Generator that creates classes from a service definition in a json file. 

Predefined data types:
```
uint8  -> uint8_t
uint16 -> uint16_t
uint32 -> uint32_t
uint64 -> uint64_t
int8   -> int8_t
int16  -> int16_t
int32  -> int32_t
int64  -> int64_t
float32  -> float 
float64  -> double
bool     -> bool/uint8_t (2 to 8 consecutive bools are treated as one uint8_t)
string   -> string (a terminating '\n' is always appended unless it is already there)
```
Defining your own data type:
```
{
    "package":"<pacage_name>",
    "data_structure":{
        "<data_structure_name>":{
            "<field_name>":"<type>", ...
        }
    }
}
```
Example of a custom 

Defining your own service:
```
{
    "include":[],
    "package":"<pacage_name>",
    "someip":{
        "<service_name>":{
            "service_id":<uint16 service id>,
            "major_version":<uint8_t>,
            "minor_version":<uint32_t>,
            "methods":{
                "<method_name>":{
                    "id":<uint16 method id>,
                    "data_structure":{
                        "name":"<field_name>",
                        "type":"<data_type>"
                    }
                }
            },
            "events":{
                "<event_name>":{
                    "id":<uint16 event id>,
                    "data_structure":{
                        "name":"<field_name>",
                        "type":"<data_type>"
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
```